.TH "OPS\-CONFIGURATION" 1 "" "ops" "Miscellaneous"
.SH NAME
ops\-configuration \- the configuration files and keys ops reads
.SH CONFIGURATION
.TP
\fBdeploy.registry\fR \fIstring\fR
the registry to push to (in \&.ops.yaml) (used by: ops deploy)
.TP
\fBdeploy.replicas\fR \fIint\fR
how many to run (default 1) (used by: ops deploy)
.TP
\fBdeploy.retries\fR \fIint\fR
how many times to retry (default 1) (used by: ops deploy)
.br
between 0 and 9
.TP
\fBprofile\fR \fIstring\fR
the output profile (used by: ops) [short|long]
.RS
.RS 2
\fBshort\fR \- one line each
.br
\fBlong\fR \- every field
.RE
.RE
.TP
\fBregion\fR \fIstring\fR
the default region (beta) (used by: ops)
.sp
The region commands use when none is given.
.br
must look like eu\-1
.SH FILES
The first file listed that sets a key supplies it.
.TP
\fI~/.ops.yaml\fR
A configuration file.
.TP
\fI\&.ops.yaml\fR
in the working directory or the nearest parent holding one
.TP
\fI\&./secrets.json\fR
or the file \-\-secrets names; profiles under "stages", chosen by \-\-stage
(default dev)
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBops\fR(1)
